    "heading": "Col de Pennes - Climb it twice! (Vercors, Drome department)",
    "highlight": "First video with built-in track segments: As of December 2022, the Incyclist app supports the selection of individual track segments. This video is my first production providing track segments: the route can be cycled as a whole or just select one of both climbs with or without the respective descents.",
    "description": "A nice pass in the French Diois region. We climb the Col twice: we first take the northeastern approach from Recoubeau via Jansac (10 km, approx. 5%) and cycle down to the Roanne Valley via the steep southwestern descent (approx. 9%). Then we climb the pass from the southwestern side taking the winding road along rocky walls above a deeply incised valley offering spectacular views on beautiful mountainous surroundings. We then go down again on the north side via Barnave.",
